  "usage": [
    "Keep the English spelling and hyphenation the book uses — up-thrust, shake-out, no demand, market-maker.",
    "Inflect around the term in Punjabi rather than inside it: 'volume ਵੱਧ ਹੈ', not a Gurmukhi transliteration of volume.",
